    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760920/extras/3016e0d0707f1d9d52f4c58ac3d3e976.poster.avif?t=1754510643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760920/extras/3016e0d0707f1d9d52f4c58ac3d3e976.webm?t=1754510643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760920/extras/3016e0d0707f1d9d52f4c58ac3d3e976.mp4?t=1754510643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night of the duat\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's something spooky in this tomb...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in the shoes of Sarah Carraway, an archaeologist exploring the long forgotten halls of the ancient kingdom and discover a dark secret hidden below the sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a first-person narrative-driven exploration game with conversation mechanics, puzzle solving and horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle solving</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized graphics in an atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative experience</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760920/extras/3016e0d0707f1d9d52f4c58ac3d3e976.poster.avif?t=1754510643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760920/extras/3016e0d0707f1d9d52f4c58ac3d3e976.webm?t=1754510643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760920/extras/3016e0d0707f1d9d52f4c58ac3d3e976.mp4?t=1754510643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night of the duat\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's something spooky in this tomb...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in the shoes of Sarah Carraway, an archaeologist exploring the long forgotten halls of the ancient kingdom and discover a dark secret hidden below the sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a first-person narrative-driven exploration game with conversation mechanics, puzzle solving and horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle solving</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized graphics in an atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative experience</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Uncover ancient secrets in this exploration horror adventure. Join a team of archaeologists as they explore a cursed Egyptian tomb, solve intricate puzzles, and unveil a buried mystery that was never meant to be found.",
